### ========================================
### COMP-TOGETHER API - Tests Backend
### ========================================
### Instrucciones:
### 1. Asegúrate de tener instalada la extensión "REST Client" en VSCode
### 2. Ejecuta las peticiones en orden (click en "Send Request")
### 3. Copia el token que devuelve LOGIN y pégalo en @token
### ========================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@token = TU_TOKEN_AQUI


### ========================================
### AUTENTICACIÓN
### ========================================

### 1. REGISTER - Crear usuario nuevo
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Pérez",
  "email": "juan@test.com",
  "phone": "123456789",
  "registration_date": "2026-02-02",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 2. LOGIN - Iniciar sesión (GUARDA EL TOKEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "juan@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### 3. LOGOUT - Cerrar sesión
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


### ========================================
### USUARIOS
### ========================================

### 4. VER MI PERFIL
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 5. ACTUALIZAR PERFIL
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/update
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Juan Actualizado",
  "phone": "987654321"
}

###


### ========================================
### CASAS (HOUSES)
### ========================================

### 6. CREAR CASA (guarda el invite_code)
POST {{baseUrl}}/houses/create
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Piso Valencia Centro"
}

###

### 7. VER MI CASA
GET {{baseUrl}}/houses/my-house
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 8. UNIRSE A CASA CON CÓDIGO
POST {{baseUrl}}/houses/join
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invite_code": "ABC12345"
}

###

### 9. CAMBIAR NOMBRE DE LA CASA
PUT {{baseUrl}}/houses/update-name
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Piso Nuevo Nombre"
}

###

### 10. SALIR DE LA CASA
POST {{baseUrl}}/houses/leave
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 11. ELIMINAR CASA (solo creador)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/houses/destroy
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


### ========================================
### GASTOS (EXPENSES)
### ========================================

### 12. LISTAR GASTOS DE MI CASA
GET {{baseUrl}}/expenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 13. CREAR GASTO
POST {{baseUrl}}/expenses/store
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Luz febrero",
  "amount": 45.50,
  "date": "2026-02-01"
}

###

### 14. VER DETALLE DE UN GASTO (cambia el ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/expenses/show/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 15. ACTUALIZAR GASTO (cambia el ID)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/expenses/update/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Luz febrero actualizado",
  "amount": 50.00,
  "date": "2026-02-01"
}

###

### 16. ELIMINAR GASTO (cambia el ID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/expenses/destroy/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 17. VER ESTADÍSTICAS DEL MES
GET {{baseUrl}}/expenses/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###


### ========================================
### FLUJO DE PRUEBA COMPLETO RECOMENDADO
### ========================================
### 1. REGISTER (#1)
### 2. LOGIN (#2) - Copia el token que devuelve
### 3. Pega el token arriba en la línea 10: @token = AQUI_TU_TOKEN
### 4. CREAR CASA (#6)
### 5. VER MI CASA (#7) - Verifica que tienes invite_code
### 6. CREAR GASTO (#13)
### 7. LISTAR GASTOS (#12)
### 8. VER ESTADÍSTICAS (#17)
### ========================================